---
/** Dark "Behavior is the contract" section: observe → assert → explain. */
---

<section class="recorder-principle">
  <div class="recorder-wrap">
    <p class="recorder-index">02 / EVIDENCE OVER OPINION</p>
    <div class="recorder-principle-head">
      <h2 class="recorder-display">Behavior is the contract.</h2>
      <p>
        Agents are non-deterministic. Your acceptance criteria shouldn't be.
        Define what must happen, then evaluate captured evidence on each run.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="recorder-contract">
      <article><span>OBSERVE</span><h3>What the agent did</h3><p>Tool calls, normalized commands, work-directory artifacts, skills, transcript, and final response.</p></article>
      <i>→</i>
      <article><span>ASSERT</span><h3>What the test requires</h3><p>Explicit matchers authored in TypeScript or YAML and compiled before the harness runs.</p></article>
      <i>→</i>
      <article><span>EXPLAIN</span><h3>Why it passed or failed</h3><p>Evaluator-recorded evidence attached to assertion results for inspection and comparison.</p></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .recorder-principle {
    padding-block: 120px 130px;
    background: var(--dark);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .recorder-principle-head {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.2fr) minmax(320px, 0.8fr);
    gap: 80px;
    align-items: end;
  }

  .recorder-principle-head > p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #aaa;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .recorder-contract {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 36px 1fr 36px 1fr;
    gap: 14px;
    align-items: stretch;
    margin-top: 80px;
    border-block: 1px solid var(--dark-line);
  }

  .recorder-contract article {
    padding: 28px 10px;
  }

  .recorder-contract article span {
    color: var(--signal);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .recorder-contract h3 {
    margin: 42px 0 10px;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .recorder-contract p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #929292;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .recorder-contract > i {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    color: #777;
    font-style: normal;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .recorder-principle {
      padding-block: 85px 95px;
    }

    .recorder-principle-head {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 26px;
    }

    .recorder-contract {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      margin-top: 50px;
    }

    .recorder-contract > i {
      height: 28px;
      justify-content: start;
      font-size: 0;
      transform: none;
    }

    .recorder-contract > i::after {
      content: '↓';
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .recorder-contract article {
      padding-block: 20px;
    }

    .recorder-contract h3 {
      margin-top: 24px;
    }
  }
</style>
